{"4434150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FossilFrontier", "steam_appid": 4434150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore uncharted lands and collect ancient life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FossilFrontier is an excavation experience game where you dig up fossils and build your own collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fossils discovered in the field can be cleaned and restored in the lab, completing them as skeletal specimens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small fragments gradually transform into the forms of colossal beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed specimens can be displayed in your exhibition space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enrich your collection and build your very own museum.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore uncharted lands and collect ancient life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FossilFrontier is an excavation experience game where you dig up fossils and build your own collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fossils discovered in the field can be cleaned and restored in the lab, completing them as skeletal specimens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small fragments gradually transform into the forms of colossal beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed specimens can be displayed in your exhibition space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enrich your collection and build your very own museum.</p>", "short_description": "This game is about exploring the desert, digging up fossils, and reconstructing them.", "supported_languages": "Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434150/46d9c6817dd5b27b4aa9bfcacc8371c89d2eb1bf/header.jpg?t=1771592874", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434150/d6e5d610240f40394e73d7edebad406bcc0e5188/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771592874", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item